  "screenwriter_raw": "{\n  \"pseudos\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p1\",\n      \"text\": \"With the heat's absurd timing squeezing the grid, officials found themselves orchestrating a dramatic blackout ballet. They directed emergency load shedding—a last-ditch emergency measure to keep a critical 230-kilovolt transmission line from overloading—after the Visayas plunged into a red alert. The result was a glorious blackout spectacle, leaving more than 950 megawatts unavailable, a chaotic dance between demand and a grid's desperate, flailing response.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.85,\n      \"center\": \"how-2\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-2\", \"how-2\", \"result-0\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p2\",\n      \"text\": \"The grid operator, the power overseer for the Philippines, watched the island group's situation spiral. After a generator failure from Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2 and ongoing power interruptions, the high demand from seasonal heat was the final straw. They issued an emergency alert, a frantic grid management action, leaving the region facing a massive, capacity-dimming energy deficit that was anything but a joke.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.78,\n      \"center\": \"who-0\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-0\", \"why-1\", \"why-2\", \"how-1\", \"result-0\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p3\",\n      \"text\": \"As the grid operator, I saw the red alert light up my screen—a frantic grid management action born from a foolish breakdown of a flimsy performer that tripped. The heatwave's demand spike, the long-running gag of broken plants, it all converged. My team orchestrated a desperate control action to stabilize the grid, but the outcome was stark: a significant power shortage across the Visayas, our island group left in a precarious, dimming balance.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.72,\n      \"center\": \"who-0\",\n      \"channel\": \"focalized\",\n      \"focal\": \"who-0\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-0\", \"why-1\", \"why-2\", \"how-1\", \"how-2\", \"result-0\"]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
